#. engine/messages/storey_titles.py (ticket 19b): the storeys a sheet's title names against those its plans' titles name.
msgid "engine.storey_titles.differ"
msgstr "The title of {named, select, title {“{sheet}”} other {{sheet}}} names “{stated}”, but its plans name other storeys: {not_drawn, plural, =0 {} one {# storey in the title has no plan} other {# storeys in the title have no plan}}{not_drawn, plural, =0 {} other {{not_named, plural, =0 {} other {, and }}}}{not_named, plural, =0 {} one {# storey on a plan is not in the title} other {# storeys on the plans are not in the title}}. Check which is right before the sheet is confirmed."
